Soccer Improved: your pocket-sized soccer coach for all skill levels. Set goals, receive personalized training plans, and access a vast library of exercises. Customize training based on equipment, track progress with skill tests, and enhance your game knowledge. Upgrade to PRO for exclusive content. Train smarter, play better!


// Personalized training plans
Receive tailor-made training plans designed to help you achieve your main goal and subgoals, ensuring optimal progress.

// 1000 exercises
Choose from a vast library of nearly 1000 soccer drills, covering various skills and techniques to keep your training fresh and engaging.

// Track your improvement
Regularly assess your soccer abilities through skill tests, allowing you to monitor your progress and fine-tune your training plan.

// ​​Set 1 main goal and 2 subgoals
Define your primary objective and two supporting goals to create a focused path towards soccer success.

// For everyone
Whether you’re a beginner, intermediate, or advanced player, Soccer Improved caters to all skill levels and ambitions.

// Don’t worry about equipment
Indicate which equipment you have (to get the right exercises): Input your available equipment to receive customized exercises that work best with your resources.

// Knowledge videos
Enhance your understanding of the game with informative videos, covering topics like tactics, strategies, and soccer-specific fitness.

// Get the full experience with PRO
Upgrade to Soccer Improved PRO for access to additional drills, in-depth performance analytics, and exclusive educational content to elevate your game even further.

- Terms of use: https://www.soccerimproved.com/terms-of-service
- Privacy policy: https://www.soccerimproved.com/privacy-policy

Мы добавили в Приложение новый раздел "Споры", надеемся, вам он понравится.
Только, пожалуйста, не путайте ни с тотализатором ни со ставками. Ибо тут вы можете создавать любой предмет спора, все ограниченно только вашей фантазией, а игра идет не на деньги, а на виртуальные очки и не против "конторы", а против конкретных оппонентов.
Это не способ заработка, а попытка развлечь вас при просмотре даже самого скучного матча, из которого можно сделать интереснейший предмет спора.

Обе российские лиги РПЛ и ФНЛ;
Текстовые онлайн трансляции матчей;
Push-уведомления о событиях в матче с участием любой команды;
Составы команд и статистика по каждому игроку;
Календарь и расписание матчей по датам и турам с возможностью отфильтровать для любой из команд;
Оформление в цветах любимого клуба;
Возможность загрузки собственных обоев.

Meet the professional boxing round timer! This app, simple and easy to use, is suitable for any type of training and competition preparation. Use the timer during boxing training, martial arts and wrestling classes, fitness, etc. 

Features:

- ability to create your own timers;
-Intuitive interface;
- Flexible settings of intervals, suitable not only for professionals, but also for beginners in sports;
- ready-made profiles for different sports;
- Signals of the beginning and end of rounds. 

Boxing timer is one of the best applications for amateur and professional boxing, MMA and any other martial arts and an excellent assistant for training at home.

